  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building justice and peace through REDUCED INEQUALITIES in Palestine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">REDUCED INEQUALITES will empower marginalised youth (age 13-35), with a special focus on youth with disabilities and young women, to secure financial stability and to take control of their economic opportunities. This is done through saving and investment groups, entrepreneurship &amp; vocational trainings and awareness &amp; advocacy campaigns. Youth with disabilities will also be empowered to stand up for their rights; receive assistive aids; and be supported back to school and work.</narrative>
  </description>
